@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:For Talent Seek: Initially;
:At the same time;
split
:Check the Referee Reports;
stop
split again
:monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed;
:v1: Have Referee Reports been completed? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:Proceed with the process;
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:if they have not been completed;
:flag it and send a reminder;
:check again if the Referee Reports have been completed;
:v2: Check again if the Referee Reports have been completed ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Yes'])
:Continue with the process;
else ([v2 = 'No'])
:If not;
:flag it again and send another reminder;
endif
endif
:Organize interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates;
:Receive feedback from the interview candidates;
:Check if a Psychometric Test is required;
:v4: Check if a Psychometric Test is required ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'Yes'])
:Check if an HR Specialist is required;
:v5: Check if an HR Specialist is required ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v5 = 'Yes'])
:Schedule the test with a third party;
else ([v5 = 'No'])
:Proceed to complete the Psychometric Test;
endif
else ([v4 = 'No'])
:Continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection;
endif
:Request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process;
stop
end split
